+		 * Allow ACS scan on DFS channels when DCS triggers a channel change.
+		 *
+		 * When DCS is enabled (e.g. WLAN or CW interference detection) on a 5G radio
+		 * with ACS enabled, a DCS-triggered channel change causes hostapd to reject
